  "content": "<h3><strong>使用全新多样的武器战斗，完全支持生存模式！</strong><br><br></h3>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_99dbef22-c16c-4652-92f9-9c670571c480.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"140\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>许多武器专为搭配我的另一个模组<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasy-armor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇幻护甲</a></strong>而设计，建议搭配使用。</p>\n<p>所有武器属性均与下界合金剑相同。若已拥有下界合金剑，制作过程将非常简单。</p>\n<p>您只需制作一些<strong>炽焰石</strong>并将其与剑类物品合成。其余配方可通过JEI查看。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4188cf68-dc11-4e14-b705-8be7f9fc9a67.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"314\" height=\"157\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_67a762ac-fb78-4dad-9518-9efce2f5e8df.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"314\" height=\"157\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">欢迎基于本模组制作整合包/数据包/资源包，如需帮助可联系我。<br>未经书面许可，严禁创建分叉版本、重新上传或以任何形式使用素材资源。<br>特此重申。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
